{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09556","headline":"同诸公游云公禅寺 · 张谓","name":"同诸公游云公禅寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共许寻鸡足，谁能惜马蹄。\n长空净云雨，斜日半虹霓。\n檐下千峰转，窗前万木低。\n看花寻径远，听鸟入林迷。\n地与喧闻隔，人将物我齐。\n不知樵客意，何事武陵谿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张谓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}